{"id":"n4-123","pattern":"より","aliases":["yori"],"level":"N4","purpose":"Mark the reference point for a comparison.","groups":["comparison","connecting ideas"],"keywords":["comparison","connecting ideas","compare things limit choices differences","connect ideas explain identify things","Reference noun / clause + より.","Today is warmer than yesterday.","Cycling is faster than walking.","This road was longer than I expected."],"comparisons":[],"formation":["Reference noun / clause + より."],"register":"Neutral","restrictions":"The item before より is the benchmark, not automatically the greater item.","mistake":"Understand the direction from the full sentence.","related":[],"examples":[{"segments":[{"text":"昨日","reading":"きのう","lemma":"昨日"},{"text":"より","role":"Mark the reference point for a comparison. Reference noun / clause + より."},{"text":"今日","reading":"きょう","lemma":"今日"},{"text":"は"},{"text":"暖かい","reading":"あたたかい","lemma":"暖かい"},{"text":"です"},{"text":"。"}],"translation":"Today is warmer than yesterday.","note":"A time benchmark."},{"segments":[{"text":"歩く","reading":"あるく","lemma":"歩く"},{"text":"より","role":"Mark the reference point for a comparison. Reference noun / clause + より."},{"text":"自転車","reading":"じてんしゃ","lemma":"自転車"},{"text":"の"},{"text":"ほう"},{"text":"が"},{"text":"速い","reading":"はやい","lemma":"速い"},{"text":"。"}],"translation":"Cycling is faster than walking.","note":"Compare actions."},{"segments":[{"text":"この"},{"text":"道","reading":"みち","lemma":"道"},{"text":"は"},{"text":"思っ","reading":"おもっ","lemma":"思う"},{"text":"た"},{"text":"より","role":"Mark the reference point for a comparison. Reference noun / clause + より."},{"text":"長かっ","reading":"ながかっ","lemma":"長い"},{"text":"た"},{"text":"。"}],"translation":"This road was longer than I expected.","note":"An expectation as benchmark."}]}
